{"title":"이토록 순수한 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=eDDeV/hAJq6HbNYq/5kbtNazdPCXrFvayXp215k&filename=th3","synopsis":"“마음이 생겨서 뮤즈가 된 걸까,아니면 뮤즈였기에 처음부터 마음이 있었던 걸까?”순문학만을 고집하던 정다은.우연히 마주한 한 권의 성인소설이 그녀의 일상을 흔들어 놓는다.처음 느껴보는 낯선 설렘과 자극.그저 읽는 데서 그치지 않고, 직접 쓰기로 결심한다.하지만 익숙했던 문장은 낯선 장르 앞에서 자꾸만 미끄러지고,무언가가 부족했다.답답함에 다시 찾은 오래된 서점.그리고 그곳에서—정다은은 한 사람을 만나게 된다.절대 들켜선 안 될 감정,그리고 뮤즈를 향한 감당할 수 없는 사랑.이건, 시작하지 말았어야 했다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":247,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":241,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":263,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":249,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":268,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":236,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":265,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":212,"change":{"type":"up","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":244,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":227,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"dat